The Goal of This Module
By the end of this document + trainer session, you will be able to: ask the right work auth question on every call, recognise which visa types are acceptable for a given req, and avoid the most common compliance mistakes that new recruiters make.

How to Use This Reference
This document has three life stages in your training:

Stage 1
Pre-Read
Read through before the trainer session. You don't need to memorise everything — just get familiar with the vocabulary and structure. The trainer will explain the nuances.

Stage 2
Deep Revision
After the session, come back and read with the trainer's explanations in mind. Use the quiz section to test yourself. Aim to explain each concept aloud in your own words.

Stage 3
On-the-Job Quick Ref
During live calls and submissions, use the Decision Matrix page and the Screening Scenarios page as a 10-second lookup. Bookmark this file for daily use.


  
