<div id="pg-usa" class="page">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="part-badge">Part A · Section 1</div>
    <h2>The US Economy, Staffing Market &amp; Your Working Day</h2>
    <p>You are recruiting for US companies from India. Understanding the scale and structure of this market makes everything else make sense.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content-wrap">

    <h2 class="sec-title">Why the US Staffing Market?</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">The scale of this market is not abstract — it explains why your job exists and why it matters.</p>
    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="val">$27T+</div><div class="lbl">US GDP — world's largest economy</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="val">$218B+</div><div class="lbl">US staffing industry annual revenue</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="val">3M+</div><div class="lbl">Workers placed every single week</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="val">~40%</div><div class="lbl">Fortune 500 workforce is contingent/contract</div></div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:32px;">Why Does the US Use So Much Contract Labour?</h2>
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>At-Will Employment</h3><p>US employment law is "at-will" — employers can terminate without cause. This makes hiring less risky, but also makes temporary contracts the norm. If a hire doesn't work out, a contract ends cleanly.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Seasonal & Project Demand</h3><p>US companies scale up for product launches, seasonal peaks, and specific projects — then scale back. Contract staffing is the mechanism for flexible workforce sizing.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Cost Efficiency</h3><p>A contract worker on W-2 through an agency costs the client a bill rate — no health insurance, 401k, or PTO obligation. Significant cost savings vs. a permanent hire.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Speed</h3><p>Staffing agencies can place a qualified contractor in 48–72 hours. Permanent hiring takes 4–8 weeks. When a project starts, speed wins.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Compliance Outsourcing</h3><p>The agency handles employment taxes, background checks, drug tests, and compliance. The client takes the talent without the administrative burden.</p></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">
    <h2 class="sec-title">US Geography & Your Calling Window</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">There are 4 major US time zones. Knowing them determines when you pick up the phone.</p>

