        <div class="ask-block">
          <h4>Verify (Quick Checks Only)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Is your Green Card current and not expired? (Rare — 10-year validity, but worth confirming)</li>
            <li>Are you comfortable with a W-2 contract arrangement?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="say-block">Perfect — Green Card is the cleanest work authorisation for this role. You're fully eligible. Let me walk you through the details of the position.</div>
        <div class="flag-block">Almost none for work auth. Ensure GC is not expired (rare — 10-year validity, and residency status continues even during renewal). Confirm W-2 comfort if it's a contract role.</div>
        <div class="action-block">Proceed immediately. Green Card candidates are priority submissions. Note GC status prominently in your submission profile in Ceipal. Do not delay — every other agency is also looking for GC candidates.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

